### UC05: report a user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/report-block/report
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reportedId":3,"reasonType":"FRAUD","reasonDesc":"Invalid trade evidence","tradeContext":"SH_SELLER"}

### UC05: block and query
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/report-block/block
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"targetUserId":3}

GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/report-block/block/check/3
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### UC05: administrator audit
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/admin/reports/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reportId":1,"decision":1,"adminRemark":"confirmed","customDelta":20}
